mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >《风险揭示书》：</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >指作为招银理财招智睿和稳健</font>(安盈优选)360天持有期2号混合类理财计划销售文件不可分割组成部分的风险揭示书，以及对该文件的有效修改或补充。</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l19 level1 lfo4;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(3)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >《理财产品投资协议书》：</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >指由投资者和管理人签署的，作为招银理财招智睿和稳健</font>(安盈优选)360天持有期2号混合类理财计划销售文件不可分割组成部分的《理财产品投资协议书》，以及对该文件的有效修改或补充。</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l19 level1 lfo4;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(4)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >理财计划合同：</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >指《产品说明书》、《风险揭示书》和《理财产品投资协议书》的总称。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l19 level1 lfo4;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(5)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >销售文件：</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >指《产品说明书》、《风险揭示书》、《理财产品投资协议书》以及《销售（代理销售）协议书》和《投资者权益须知》。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l19 level1 lfo4;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(6)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >《销售（代理销售）协议书》：</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >指由投资者和销售服务机构签署的，作为招银理财招智睿和稳健</font>(安盈优选)360天持有期2号混合类理财计划销售文件不可分割组成部分的《销售（代理销售）协议书》，以及对该文件的有效修改或补充。</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;mso-outline-level:2;line-height:125%;
mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >3.<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >理财产品用语</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l24 level1 lfo5;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(1)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >理财计划</font>/理财产品/产品：</span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >指招银理财招智睿和稳健</font>(安盈优选)360天持有期2号混合类理财计划。</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l24 level1 lfo5;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(2)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >认购</font>/申购资金：</span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >指在认购</font>/申购期，认购/申购人为认购/申购理财计划份额而向管理人交付的货币资金。为免疑义，认购/申购资金不包含认购/申购资金在认购/申购期内所产生的利息。</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l24 level1 lfo5;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(3)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >理财计划募集资金：</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >指认购人按照理财计划合同的约定交付，并经管理人确认认购成功而进入理财计划账户的认购资金的总和。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l24 level1 lfo5;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(4)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >理财计划资金：</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >指理财计划募集资金，以及管理人管理、运用、处分该等理财计划募集资金而取得且归于理财计划所有的货币资金。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l24 level1 lfo5;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(5)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >理财计划费用：</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >指投资管理人为成立理财计划及处理理财计划事务目的而支出的所有费用。详见</font><font face="宋体" >“理财计划费用”。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l24 level1 lfo5;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(6)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >执行费用：</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >指与理财投资或标的资产相关且为理财计划利益目的而进行的诉讼或仲裁等法律程序相关的费用，包括但不限于诉讼（仲裁）费、财产保全费、律师费和执行费，以及因诉讼或仲裁之需要而委托中介机构或司法机构进行鉴定、评估等而产生的费用。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l24 level1 lfo5;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(7)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >理财计划税费：</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >指根据适用法律和理财计划文件规定，理财计划应缴纳和承担的税收和有权政府部门向理财计划征收的税费、规费。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l24 level1 lfo5;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(8)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >理财计划利益：</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >指投资者因持有理财计划份额，按照销售文件约定取得或有权取得的理财产品管理人分配的理财计划资产。在理财计划对外投资资产正常回收的情况下，该等财产性利益包括投资本金及理财计划收益。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l24 level1 lfo5;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(9)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >投资本金：</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >就每一投资者而言，指投资者为认购</font>/申购（如有）理财计划份额而向理财产品管理人交付的货币资金，即该投资者在本理财计划下的初始投资资金。就每一理财计划份额而言，在本理财计划成立时每一理财计划份额的投资本金为1元。</span><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >为避免疑义，投资本金的称谓仅为方便计算理财计划利益而创设的，并非对投资者投资本金不受损失的承诺。</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l24 level1 lfo5;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(10)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >理财计划收益：</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >指投资者投资理财计划获得的投资收益，该收益为其获得分配的全部理财计划利益中扣除投资本金的部分。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l24 level1 lfo5;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(11)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >利益分配：</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >指理财产品管理人向投资者进行理财计划利益分配，具有《产品说明书》之</font><font face="宋体" >“理财计划利益分配”的含义。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l24 level1 lfo5;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(12)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >期间分配：</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >指在理财计划终止日（不含当日）前的理财计划利益分配。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l24 level1 lfo5;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(13)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >终止分配：</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >指在理财计划终止日当日及之后的理财计划利益分配。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
