mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >理财计划份额：</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >指管理人依据理财计划文件向投资者发行的一种资产受益凭证。理财计划份额持有人基于其所持有的理财计划份额享有理财计划利益、承担理财计划资产风险。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l24 level1 lfo5;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(15)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >理财计划份额净值：</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >指理财计划份额的单位净值，即每</font>1份理财计划份额以人民币计价的价格。</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l24 level1 lfo5;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(16)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >理财计划份额累计净值：</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >指理财计划份额的单位净值与产品成立后历次累计单位收益分配的总和。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l24 level1 lfo5;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(17)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >理财计划估值：</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >指计算评估理财计划资产以确定理财计划份额单位净值的过程。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l24 level1 lfo5;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(18)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >业绩比较基准：指管理人基于过往投资经验及对产品存续期投资市场波动的预判而对本产品所设定的投资目标，业绩比较基准不是预期收益率，不代表本产品的未来表现和实际收益，不构成投资管理人对本产品的收益承诺。</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l24 level1 lfo5;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(19)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >认购：</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >指投资者根据《产品说明书》约定申请购买本产品理财计划份额的行为。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l24 level1 lfo5;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(20)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >申购</font>/赎回：</span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >指在理财计划的开放期内，投资者向理财计划管理人提出申请对理财计划份额进行购买或卖出的行为。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l24 level1 lfo5;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(21)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >巨额赎回：</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >在理财计划存续期内，若理财计划单个开放日净赎回申请份额（赎回申请份额总数扣除申购申请份额总数）超过本理财计划上一交易日日终份额的</font>10%时，即为发生巨额赎回。</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;mso-outline-level:2;line-height:125%;
mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >4.<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >相关账户用语</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;" ><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >理财托管账户</font>/理财计划账户：</span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >指理财计划管理人以理财产品的名义在托管人处单独开立的资金管理账户，理财计划资金的一切收支活动，均必须通过该账户进行。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
