mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >投资管理人</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:22.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >本理财计划的投资管理人为招银理财，负责本理财计划的投资运作和产品管理，投资者在此授权并同意管理人享有以下权利：</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l17 level1 lfo13;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >1.<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >按照本理财计划文件的约定，管理、运用和处分理财计划资金。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l17 level1 lfo13;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >2.<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >按照本理财计划文件的约定，及时、足额获得投资管理费和本产品说明书约定的其他费用（如有）。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l17 level1 lfo13;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >3.<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >管理人以其固有财产先行垫付因处理本理财计划相关事务所支出的理财计划费用及税费的，对理财计划资金享有优先受偿的权利。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l17 level1 lfo13;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >4.<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >管理人有权根据本理财计划文件的约定提前终止本理财计划或延长本理财计划的期限。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l17 level1 lfo13;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >5.<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >管理人有权单方调整本理财计划的认购规模上限、认购</font>/申购起点、认购/申购金额上限、认购/申购资金的最低金额、单笔认购上限、单笔申购上限、单日净申购比例上限、单一投资者持有上限 、赎回上限等要素，</span><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >以及决定及调整因投资资产而产生的资产服务费（如有）等要素。</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l17 level1 lfo13;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >6.<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >管理人有权按照法律规定和监管机构的要求将投资者的信息向有权部门或相关机构披露。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l17 level1 lfo13;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >7.<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >以理财计划投资管理人的名义，依照法律法规相关规定以及为理财计划的利益，对被投资的信托计划、资管计划、各类基金（含公募基金和私募基金）、公司</font>/企业等行使出资人/投资者权利（包括但不限于表决投票的权利）以及行使因理财计划财产投资于证券类基础资产（含债券、股票等）或其他基础资产（包括但不限于债权类资产）所产生的相关权利。</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l17 level1 lfo13;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >8.<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >以理财计划投资管理人的名义，依照法律法规相关规定以及代表理财计划份额持有人的利益行使代为追索的权利（包括但不限于提起诉讼</font>/仲裁、申请保全/执行的权利）或者实施其他风险处置，行使、放弃、变更相关权利义务等法律行为。</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
