mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >理财计划申购、赎回</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
