mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >最短持有期：本理财计划对投资者的每笔有效认</font>/申购份额设置360个自然日的最短持有期限，</span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >即每笔理财计划份额从产品成立日（对认购份额而言）</font>/申购申请对应的开放日（含该日）至其后第360个自然日（如该日为非交易日，则顺延至下一个交易日）的前一日，投资者不能提出赎回申请；从360个自然日（如该日为非交易日，则顺延至下一个交易日）（含）之后，投资者可以在开放日提出赎回申请。</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;mso-outline-level:2;line-height:125%;
mso-list:l12 level1 lfo16;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >2.<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >开放日</font>/申购、赎回期：</span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >本理财计划存续期内，每个交易日为理财产品开放日。开放日内的申购、赎回申请，将以开放日当天的净值进行确认。销售服务机构实际受理时间可能与说明书不一致，具体以销售服务机构通知为准。</font></span><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >尽管存在前述约定，投资者不得赎回持有期低于最短持有期的理财计划份额。</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;mso-outline-level:2;line-height:125%;
mso-list:l12 level1 lfo16;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >3.<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >单笔申购上限：</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" >A份额投资者单笔申购上限为5000万元和A份额规模上限的二者的较小值，J份额投资者单笔申购上限为1亿元和J份额规模上限的二者的较小值，NJ份额投资者单笔申购上限为5000万元和NJ份额规模上限的二者的较小值，V份额投资者单笔申购上限为1亿元和V份额规模上限的二者的较小值，XY份额投资者单笔申购上限为1亿元和XY份额规模上限的二者的较小值，ZX份额投资者单笔申购上限为1亿元和ZX份额规模上限的二者的较小值，且各份额投资者应遵守单一投资者持有上限。管理人/销售服务机构有权拒绝超限部分的申请。对于管理人/销售服务机构决定拒绝的申购申请，视为申购不成功。</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;mso-outline-level:2;line-height:125%;
mso-list:l12 level1 lfo16;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >4.<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >申购、赎回确认日：</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >管理人在每个开放日后的</font>2个交易日内对投资者申购、赎回申请的有效性进行登记并确认，该日为申购、赎回确认日。</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;mso-outline-level:2;line-height:125%;
mso-list:l12 level1 lfo16;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >5.<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >申购、赎回原则：</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l27 level1 lfo17;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(1)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >投资者赎回本理财计划时，管理人不承诺保证本金，也不承诺任何收益；</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l27 level1 lfo17;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(2)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >投资者申购、赎回本理财计划时，采用</font><font face="宋体" >“未知价”原则，即本理财计划申购和赎回价格为当期开放日的理财计划份额净值；产品份额净值的公布详见“理财计划估值”。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l27 level1 lfo17;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(3)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >本理财计划采用金额申购、份额赎回的原则，即申购以金额申请，赎回以份额赎回；</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l27 level1 lfo17;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(4)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >赎回原则遵循</font><font face="宋体" >“先进先出”原则或“指定赎回”原则，投资者赎回理财计划份额时适用的赎回原则以对应的销售服务机构提供的赎回服务为准。其中，“先进先出”原则是指按照理财计划份额持有人认购、申购的先后次序进行顺序赎回；“指定赎回”原则是指按照理财计划份额持有人指定的理财计划份额明细进行赎回。</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l27 level1 lfo17;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(5)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >因不可抗力导致理财计划无法继续申购或赎回时，销售服务机构及</font>/或管理人有权拒绝或暂停接受投资者的申购或赎回的申请。</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l27 level1 lfo17;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(6)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >投资者可于申购、赎回期内向销售服务机构提出申购申请，管理人按照先申请、先申购原则确认申购申请，如累计申购份额已达到产品规模上限，管理人</font>/销售服务机构有权拒绝也有权视情况接受超出产品规模上限部分的申购申请。A份额投资者首次申购单笔最低限额为100元，高于申购单笔最低限额的金额及追加申购的金额须为1元或1元的整数倍。J份额投资者首次申购单笔最低限额为20万元，高于申购单笔最低限额的金额及追加申购的金额须为1元或1元的整数倍。NJ份额投资者首次申购单笔最低限额为100元，高于申购单笔最低限额的金额及追加申购的金额须为0.01元或0.01元的整数倍。V份额投资者首次申购单笔最低限额为100元，高于申购单笔最低限额的金额及追加申购的金额须为0.01元或0.01元的整数倍。XY份额投资者首次申购单笔最低限额为100元，高于申购单笔最低限额的金额及追加申购的金额须为1元或1元的整数倍。ZX份额投资者首次申购单笔最低限额为100万元，高于申购单笔最低限额的金额及追加申购的金额须为0.01元或0.01元的整数倍。销售服务机构的实际申购起点可能与说明书不一致，具体以销售服务机构通知为准。</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l27 level1 lfo17;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(7)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >当接受申购申请对存量理财计划份额持有人利益构成潜在重大不利影响时，管理人可调整单笔申购上限或单一投资者持有上限、设定单日净申购比例上限、拒绝大额申购、暂停理财产品申购等措施，切实保护存量理财计划份额持有人的合法权益。管理人基于投资运作与风险控制的需要，可采取上述措施对理财计划产品规模予以控制，并将根据本理财计划产品说明书约定的信息披露方式向投资者进行信息披露。</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l27 level1 lfo17;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(8)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >投资者有权部分或全部赎回理财计划份额。全部赎回理财计划份额后，投资者如需再次申购，则申购的金额不得低于该份额申购起点。部分赎回理财计划份额后，</font>A份额投资者如需再行申购，则申购最低金额为1元或1元的整数倍。J份额投资者如需再行申购，则申购最低金额为1元或1元的整数倍。NJ份额投资者如需再行申购，则申购最低金额为0.01元或0.01元的整数倍。V份额投资者如需再行申购，则申购最低金额为0.01元或0.01元的整数倍。XY份额投资者如需再行申购，则申购最低金额为1元或1元的整数倍。ZX份额投资者如需再行申购，则申购最低金额为0.01元或0.01元的整数倍。销售服务机构的实际申购起点可能与说明书不一致，具体以销售服务机构通知为准。</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l27 level1 lfo17;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(9)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >销售服务机构受理投资者于申购、赎回期内提出的申购、赎回申请，并不表示对该申请成功的确认，而仅代表销售服务机构收到了申请，申请是否生效应以管理人于申购、赎回确认日的确认为准。具体而言，投资者按规定提交申购申请、全额交付款项并经销售服务机构成功冻结或预扣的，申购申请成立；如管理人在申购、赎回确认日根据投资者的申购、赎回申请为投资者成功登记申购份额、赎回份额，则视为投资者的申购、赎回申请生效，并以管理人的登记记录为准。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l27 level1 lfo17;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(10)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >投资者在申购、赎回期内提交的申购、赎回申请，在申购、赎回期可以撤销。销售服务机构实际受理时间可能与说明书不一致，具体以销售服务机构通知为准。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l27 level1 lfo17;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(11)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >投资者有权部分或全部赎回理财计划份额。如赎回将导致单个</font>A份额投资者的理财计划份额余额不足0.01份时，投资者剩余份额将被一次性全额赎回。如赎回将导致单个J份额投资者的理财计划份额余额不足0.01份时，投资者剩余份额将被一次性全额赎回。如赎回将导致单个NJ份额投资者的理财计划份额余额不足0.01份时，投资者剩余份额将被一次性全额赎回。如赎回将导致单个V份额投资者的理财计划份额余额不足0.01份时，投资者剩余份额将被一次性全额赎回。如赎回将导致单个XY份额投资者的理财计划份额余额不足0.01份时，投资者剩余份额将被一次性全额赎回。如赎回将导致单个ZX份额投资者的理财计划份额余额不足0.01份时，投资者剩余份额将被一次性全额赎回。特别地，若投资者申请赎回理财计划某一份额，导致理财计划该份额的剩余份额为零时，管理人有权按照投资者在开放日持有该份额的份额占比*开放日理财计划该份额净资产向投资者支付赎回资金。</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l27 level1 lfo17;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(12)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >对于单个投资者单个开放日申请赎回理财计划份额超过上一交易日日终理财产品总份额的</font>10%的部分，管理人有权暂停接受其赎回申请；若管理人接受该赎回申请，管理人亦有权选择延缓支付赎回款项，但延缓期限不得超过20个工作日。</span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l27 level1 lfo17;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(13)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >申购费：投资者申购本理财计划</font>A份额、J份额、NJ份额、V份额、XY份额、ZX份额无需支付申购费。</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l27 level1 lfo17;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(14)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >赎回费：投资者赎回本理财计划</font>A份额、J份额、NJ份额、V份额、XY份额、ZX份额时无需支付赎回费。</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l27 level1 lfo17;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(15)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >当管理人有合理理由认为接受赎回申请将损害现有投资者利益的情形时，管理人有权设置赎回上限，届时将按照本理财计划说明书约定履行相应信息披露程序。</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l27 level1 lfo17;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(16)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >当本理财计划发生大额申购或赎回情形时，管理人有权采用摆动定价机制，以确保理财计划估值的公平性。具体处理原则与操作规范遵循相关法律法规以及监管部门、自律规则的规定，并以届时管理人信息披露内容为准。</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;mso-outline-level:2;line-height:125%;
mso-list:l12 level1 lfo16;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >6.<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >巨额赎回的情形及处理方式</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l8 level1 lfo18;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(1)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >巨额赎回的认定</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:22.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;" ><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >若理财计划单个开放日净赎回申请份额（赎回申请份额总数扣除申购申请份额总数）超过上一交易日日终理财产品总份额的</font>10%，则发生巨额赎回事件。</span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l8 level1 lfo18;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(2)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >巨额赎回的处理方式</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:22.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >当理财计划出现巨额赎回时，管理人有权依照理财计划当时的资产组合状况选择全额赎回、部分赎回或延缓支付赎回款项。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" >1）全额赎回：当管理人有能力支付投资者的全部赎回申请时，按正常赎回程序执行；</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;" ><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" >2）部分赎回：当管理人认为支付投资者的赎回款项有困难或认为因支付投资者的赎回款项而进行的资产变现可能会对理财计划资产净值造成较大波动等情形时，在当日接受赎回比例不低于上一交易日日终理财产品总份额的10%的前提下，管理人有权暂停接受超过10%以上部分的赎回申请，或对超过10%以上部分的赎回申请延期办理。若管理人对于超过10%以上部分的赎回申请选择延期办理，管理人有权于开放日按照投资者赎回递交申请的顺序，依照时间优先（即先申请、先赎回）的原则确认当日受理的赎回申请；或对投资者的所有赎回申请，按照单个投资者当日申请赎回份额占当日申请赎回总份额的比例进行确认。</span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;" ><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >若管理人对于超过</font>10%以上部分的赎回申请选择延期办理，对于未能赎回部分，投资者可选择将当日未获办理的赎回申请予以撤销。投资者未选择撤销的，管理人有权延期至下一个开放日办理，延期至下一个开放日办理的赎回价格为下一个开放日的价格，顺延至下一开放日的赎回申请不享有优先确认权。</span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;" ><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" >3）延缓支付赎回款项：若理财计划连续2个开放日 (含)及以上发生巨额赎回，管理人除有权选择全额赎回或部分赎回等措施外，对于已经接受的赎回申请，管理人有权延缓支付赎回款项，但延缓支付期限不得超过20个工作日。 </span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" >4）当发生巨额赎回或连续巨额赎回，管理人选择延期办理巨额赎回申请、暂停接受赎回申请或延缓支付赎回款项时，管理人将根据本理财产品说明书约定的信息披露方式向投资者进行信息披露。</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >示例：如果最新理财计划在赎回开放日的上一交易日日终的总存续份额为</font>20亿份，在赎回开放日投资者净赎回份额大于2亿份的情形下，管理人有权选择接受全部赎回申请，管理人也有权在当日接受赎回申请不低于2亿份的前提下，对其余赎回申请暂停接受或延期办理。如次一开放日净赎回申请份额继续超过上一交易日日终理财产品总份额的10%，除上述措施外，管理人还有权对已经接受的赎回申请延缓支付赎回款项，但延缓期限不得超过20个工作日。</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;mso-outline-level:2;line-height:125%;
mso-list:l12 level1 lfo16;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >7.<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >申购、赎回程序</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l21 level1 lfo19;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(1)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >申购、赎回的申请方式</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:22.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >投资者必须在申购、赎回期内提出申购、赎回的申请。</font></span><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >投资者在提交申购申请时，须备足申购资金。</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >投资者在申购、赎回期内的申购申请被受理后，销售服务机构有权冻结或预扣人民币资金形式的申购款项，冻结或预扣期间管理人不向投资者计付利息，是否计付利息以销售服务机构为准。投资者提交赎回申请时，必须有足够的理财计划份额余额。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;mso-list:l21 level1 lfo19;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >(2)<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >申购、赎回份额的确认</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  align=justify  style="margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:22.0000pt;text-align:justify;
text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:125%;" ><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >管理人在申购、赎回确认日对投资者的申购、赎回申请的有效性进行登记确认。投资者应在申购、赎回期之后及时到提出申请的网点进行成交查询，</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >或在销售服务机构开通网上银行申购、赎回后，在网上银行进行成交查询。</font></span><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >销售服务机构实际受理时间可能与说明书不一致，具体以销售服务机构通知为准。</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:125%;
font-size:11.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >具体申购、赎回份额确认的时间安排如下：</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><table class=MsoNormalTable  border=1  cellspacing=0  style="border-collapse:collapse;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
